1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,266
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,266 --> 00:00:03,893
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,893 --> 00:00:04,946
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,146 --> 00:00:08,026
=Episode 25=

5
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,000
Zhouhan?

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:15,640
Hua?

7
00:00:17,026 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Dandelions drift across the field♪

8
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:19,106
♪Sunset in the distance♪

9
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:19,640
Grandma.

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:20,559
You...

11
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:21,960
You two know each other?

12
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,120
Grandma?

13
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,400
♪Your profile against the light♪

14
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,760
The person you were visiting today

15
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,280
was my grandma?

16
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:29,879
Wait.

17
00:00:31,079 --> 00:00:31,640
You...

18
00:00:31,839 --> 00:00:33,640
The boyfriend you told me about

19
00:00:35,119 --> 00:00:36,399
is my ungrateful grandson?

20
00:00:36,399 --> 00:00:37,500
♪Daisies bloom beside the window♪

21
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,800
♪Jasmine scents the breeze♪

22
00:00:40,866 --> 00:00:41,880
♪I remember when our eyes met♪

23
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,479
So they're a couple.

24
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:45,439
Yes, they're a good match.

25
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:47,399
Well, look at you.

26
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,640
I was wondering what heartless man

27
00:00:50,359 --> 00:00:52,119
had stolen my favorite girl's heart

28
00:00:52,479 --> 00:00:53,920
and wouldn't bring her to meet me.

29
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,640
It was you all along.

30
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,280
Grandma.

31
00:00:58,960 --> 00:00:59,439
Grandma,

32
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,560
so,

33
00:01:02,039 --> 00:01:04,439
the boy your friend helped raise

34
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:06,640
was Xie Zhouhan?

35
00:01:06,799 --> 00:01:07,760
Yes.

36
00:01:07,959 --> 00:01:09,079
That's him.

37
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:11,799
So,

38
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:14,680
you used to live in Honghe Town?

39
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:19,319
Yes.

40
00:01:24,439 --> 00:01:25,480
Hua, come here.

41
00:01:25,879 --> 00:01:27,439
Look at my photo album.

42
00:01:30,239 --> 00:01:33,719
These are photos of me when I was young.

43
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,400
You were so beautiful.

44
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,000
You still are.

45
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:41,079
Such a sweet talker.

46
00:01:44,959 --> 00:01:45,920
This page

47
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,719
has all my good friends on it.

48
00:01:48,879 --> 00:01:50,560
She's the one I told you about,

49
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,400
my very best friend.

50
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:00,719
Mom...

51
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,319
Grandma,

52
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:07,599
that friend you were
just telling me about

53
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,479
is my mom.

54
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,199
Hua.

55
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,240
You...

56
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:14,439
You're saying

57
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:16,800
she's your mother?

58
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:20,479
So you're

59
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,879
Su's daughter?

60
00:02:23,039 --> 00:02:23,560
Yes.

61
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:26,280
- Yes.
- No wonder I thought you looked

62
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:29,199
so much like your mother.

63
00:02:32,599 --> 00:02:33,280
Sweetheart,

64
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:38,159
your mother was my dearest friend.

65
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,039
I know.

66
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,080
But...

67
00:02:50,599 --> 00:02:52,280
She's gone now.

68
00:02:57,919 --> 00:03:00,080
I miss her so much.

69
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:04,759
(So)

70
00:03:05,439 --> 00:03:07,599
(he came into my life so long ago.)

71
00:03:37,479 --> 00:03:38,919
You knew I was Su Yan's daughter?

72
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:45,680
Yes.

73
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:53,039
So you agreed to our contract marriage

74
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:56,039
not just because Bao'er
came up with the crazy idea

75
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:59,319
or Grandma pressured you to marry.

76
00:03:59,879 --> 00:04:00,319
Yes.

77
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,360
But I never expected

78
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,280
to see you again.

79
00:04:08,319 --> 00:04:09,639
Then why didn't you tell me?

80
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,199
I didn't want you to feel obligated.

81
00:04:14,639 --> 00:04:15,479
But keeping this from me

82
00:04:15,719 --> 00:04:17,000
only makes me feel more obligated.

83
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:20,079
Xie Zhouhan,

84
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,800
now I understand.

85
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,759
You didn't suddenly start caring,

86
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,639
or grow to care after we married.

87
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,720
You make me breakfast,

88
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,839
remember I'm allergic to mangoes,

89
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:36,560
and know I love cherries.

90
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:44,399
Bao'er didn't tell you any of that.

91
00:04:45,079 --> 00:04:45,879
I don't want to lie to you.

92
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,079
But you've already hidden a lot from me.

93
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:54,759
I'm not angry that you care about me.

94
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:55,439
I just...

95
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,680
I just can't tell

96
00:04:58,399 --> 00:04:59,040
if you're doing this

97
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:00,759
because you like me,

98
00:05:00,959 --> 00:05:01,439
or

99
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:05,199
to repay my mom for her kindness.

100
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:10,720
Hua,

101
00:05:11,319 --> 00:05:12,360
whatever you think,

102
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:14,839
I just want you to know

103
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,560
my feelings for you are real.

104
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:23,720
I know.

105
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:25,480
I know.

106
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,560
But I need some time.

107
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:32,360
I need to think this through.

108
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,199
Okay.

109
00:06:11,883 --> 00:06:12,800
♪You say you♪

110
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:15,176
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

111
00:06:15,176 --> 00:06:17,950
♪You're just fine on your own♪

112
00:06:18,456 --> 00:06:21,040
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

113
00:06:21,376 --> 00:06:23,960
♪And the pain you face at night♪

114
00:06:25,070 --> 00:06:27,560
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

115
00:06:28,456 --> 00:06:31,010
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

116
00:06:31,256 --> 00:06:33,930
♪Some love needs no promises♪

117
00:06:34,203 --> 00:06:37,370
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

118
00:06:37,616 --> 00:06:39,950
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

119
00:06:40,350 --> 00:06:43,160
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

120
00:06:43,856 --> 00:06:46,390
♪I'm right behind you♪

121
00:06:46,776 --> 00:06:49,760
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

122
00:06:50,123 --> 00:06:52,360
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

123
00:06:52,990 --> 00:06:56,350
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

124
00:06:59,590 --> 00:07:02,560
♪I'm right behind you♪

125
00:07:03,203 --> 00:07:04,560
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

126
00:07:04,643 --> 00:07:06,360
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

127
00:07:06,563 --> 00:07:08,670
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

128
00:07:09,290 --> 00:07:10,376
♪I'm right behind you♪

129
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:12,830
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

130
00:07:13,096 --> 00:07:14,560
♪I won't claim you♪

131
00:07:14,683 --> 00:07:16,170
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

132
00:07:16,363 --> 00:07:18,830
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

133
00:07:20,210 --> 00:07:22,176
♪Waiting for you♪
